        "Libsmbclient / Libssl / Libcrypto / Libass / Libfreetype / Libfribidi / Libharfbuzz / Libdovi / Libunibreak / gmp / nettle / hogweed / gnutls / MoltenVK",
        "以上条目未逐条抄录；首次在 macOS 上 swift package resolve 后按 MPVKit Package.swift 补齐。"
